# Reload state machine: join, leave and join again (also while a reload is running), F3+T, repeated /reload.
# Every "state" line must show the same non-zero tag, recipe and stack counts.
world survival
waitloaded
wait 40
state
leave
wait 20
waitloaded
wait 20
state
cmd reload
wait 30
leave
wait 20
waitloaded
wait 20
state
reloadresources
wait 100
waitloaded
wait 20
state
cmd reload
cmd reload
wait 100
waitloaded
wait 20
state
quit
